[I] Build external dependencies for use in CPAN

[T] This module provides tools for building external (non-CPAN) dependencies
[T] for CPAN. It is mainly designed to be used at install time of a CPAN
[T] client, and work closely with Alien::Base which is used at runtime.

[U] https://metacpan.org/pod/Alien::Build

